() Tj
50.00 418.89 Td
(Meridian Capital Partners measures the fair value of all portfolio investments in accordance with) Tj
50.00 405.89 Td
( ASC 820 \(Fair Value Measurement\) and IPEV Valuation Guidelines \(December 2022 edition\).  Valuations) Tj
50.00 392.89 Td
( are prepared quarterly by the finance team under the supervision of Alejandro Torres and reviewed) Tj
50.00 379.89 Td
( independently by the firm's external auditor, KPMG LLP.) Tj
50.00 366.89 Td
() Tj
50.00 353.89 Td
(All Level 3 fair value measurements \(privately held equity and debt instruments without observable) Tj
50.00 340.89 Td
( market prices\) are reviewed by the Valuation Committee, which comprises Alejandro Torres \(chair\),) Tj
50.00 327.89 Td
( Tomasz Kowalczyk, Helena Voss, and an independent valuation advisor from FTI Consulting.  The) Tj
50.00 314.89 Td
( Valuation Committee meets within 30 days of each quarter-end.) Tj
50.00 301.89 Td
() Tj
50.00 288.89 Td
(Primary valuation methodologies applied are: \(1\) Revenue Multiple   applied to high-growth) Tj
50.00 275.89 Td
( software and technology companies using a peer group of 8 12 publicly traded comparables; \(2\)) Tj
50.00 262.89 Td
( EBITDA Multiple   applied to infrastructure and services businesses; \(3\) Discounted Cash Flow) Tj
50.00 249.89 Td
( \(DCF\)   applied where long-dated contracted cash flows exist; \(4\) Cost Minus Impairment  ) Tj
50.00 236.89 Td
( applied to early-stage companies with limited trading history.) Tj
50.00 223.89 Td
() Tj
50.00 210.89 Td
(Where multiple methodologies are applied, the Valuation Committee exercises judgement in weighting) Tj
50.00 197.89 Td
( the approaches, taking into account the stage, sector, and specific circumstances of each) Tj
50.00 184.89 Td
( investment.  Material deviations from prior-quarter valuations require a written memorandum from) Tj
50.00 171.89 Td
( the lead partner.) Tj
50.00 158.89 Td
() Tj
50.00 145.89 Td
(The Valuation Committee specifically reviewed the Level 3 inputs applied to DataForge, ZephyrData,) Tj
50.00 132.89 Td
( and VaultChain in Q4 2024, given the deterioration in comparable company multiples and the) Tj
50.00 119.89 Td
( balance-sheet stress identified in each company.  Downward adjustments were approved for all three) Tj
50.00 106.89 Td
( companies following Tomasz Kowalczyk's risk review.) Tj
